            "detailed_description": "Arkham Nightmares is an <strong>adventure</strong> game with <strong>rogue-like elements</strong>. You play Prof. Liebwerk the head physician of the <strong>Lovecraftian</strong> Arkham Sanatorium. Your task is to complete your journal with all the stories from the crazy inmates. But before they will tell you anything you have to win their trust.<br><br>During the night you will be haunted by terrible nightmares. Try to avoid those horrors or they will drive you insane. On the other hand... a little insanity might help to convince the patients to tell their stories.<br><br><strong>Feautres:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Innovative genre-mix of adventure, rogue-like and stealth gameplay<br></li><li>1920s setting with eerie atmosphere in the Lovecraftian universe<br>    </li><li>A big island to explore<br>    </li><li>Multiple-choice dialogs<br>    </li><li>Replayability<br>    </li><li>Voice-over<br>    </li><li>Jazz soundtrack<br>    </li><li>Day-Night cycle<br>    </li><li>Adjustable difficulty<br>    </li><li>Gamepad support </li></ul>",
